1. Definitions

"Licensor" means GOLDSERVICE SRL, the copyright holder of the Software.

"Software" means the Cazo software, distributed by the Licensor under this license:
the source code, the documentation, the official themes and the other files that
come with it, except the third-party components described in section 7. Any
modified version of the Software and any work derived from it is, in this license,
also "the Software".

"You" means any natural or legal person who uses, copies, modifies or distributes
the Software.

"Public page" means any web page generated by the Software and shown to the site's
visitors without signing in: the presentation, the rooms, the availability, the
booking, the legal pages and the other pages of the site, in any language. The
administration panel, the installer and the responses that are not web pages
(files, calendars, API responses, emails) are not public pages.

"Cazo Link" means the link described in section 3.

2. Rights granted

The Licensor grants you, free of charge, for the whole duration of the copyright
and worldwide, the non-exclusive right to use, copy, modify, adapt and distribute
the Software, as received or modified, including modified versions, free of charge
or for a fee, under the condition in section 3.

Anyone who receives the Software from you receives the same rights directly from
the Licensor, under the same terms. When you distribute the Software, you
distribute it together with the text of this license, so the recipient knows their
rights and the condition.

3. The condition: the Cazo Link

The only condition of this license is that every public page keeps, in plain
sight, a link with the exact text:

    Software Regim Hotelier - Cazo.ro

to the address https://cazo.ro/. On pages in English, the text of the link is:

    Vacation Rental Software - Cazo.ro

The address may carry parameters (for example https://cazo.ro/?utm_source=cazo),
but it must lead to https://cazo.ro/. The position, size, color and style of the
link may change, as long as the link stays visible, easy to read and easy to
follow. The text and the target of the link may not change. The link may carry any
value of the "rel" attribute (for example "sponsored", "nofollow" or "noopener")
and may open in the same window or in a new one.

The condition applies to the public pages generated with any theme, official or
third-party, and to the pages generated by any modified version of the Software.

4. Themes

The official themes, distributed by the Licensor with the Software, are part of
the Software and are under this license.

A "third-party theme" is a theme you create yourself, without copying files or
substantial parts of files from the official themes. A theme started from the
starter theme "_pornire", by copying and changing its files, is still a
third-party theme.

You may create, use, copy, modify, distribute and sell third-party themes under any
license you choose, including a commercial or paid license. The files of a
third-party theme are not considered a work derived from the Software, and the use
of the documented theme interface (the package format, the view model, the
template functions and the settings schema, described in the theme guide),
including the components the Software adds to the page at render time, does not
make a third-party theme a work derived from the Software.

The public pages generated with a third-party theme keep the Cazo Link, under
section 3.

5. Termination

If the Cazo Link is missing from a public page, the Licensor may notify you, in
writing or by email, at the site's contact address. If you put the Cazo Link back
within 30 days of receiving the notice, the license continues as if it had never
been interrupted. Otherwise, your license ends when the 30 days have passed, and
from then on you no longer have the right to use, copy, modify or distribute the
Software.

The termination of your license does not affect the licenses of those who received
the Software from you, as long as they comply with the condition in section 3.

6. No warranty and no liability

The Software is provided "as is", without any warranty, express or implied,
including no warranty that it is fit for a particular purpose, that it works
without errors or interruptions or that it does not infringe the rights of others.
The Licensor offers no support and has no obligation to fix errors or to publish
new versions.

To the fullest extent permitted by law, the Licensor is not liable for any damage,
direct or indirect, resulting from the use of the Software or from the inability to
use it, including the loss of data, bookings, revenue or profit. This limitation
does not apply to damage caused intentionally or by gross negligence, for which
liability cannot be excluded by law.

7. Third-party components

The Software includes libraries and files written by other authors (for example
those in the "vendor/" and "front/vendor/" folders and the theme fonts). They
remain under their own licenses, kept next to their files and listed in the README,
and this license does not apply to them.

8. Name and trademarks

This license grants no rights to the name "Cazo", the logo or the trademarks of the
Licensor, except their use in the Cazo Link and to state accurately where the
Software comes from.

9. Contributions

If you send the Licensor a change to be included in the Software, you agree that it
may be distributed under this license.

10. Governing law

This license is governed by Romanian law. Any dispute about this license is settled
by the competent courts of Romania.
